 XLOOKUP:['Find a key and return its corresponding value.','=XLOOKUP(lookup_value, lookup_array, return_array, [if_not_found], [match_mode], [search_mode])','Supply the key, aligned key and return ranges, optional missing label, match mode (0 exact, -1 next smaller, 1 next larger), and search direction (1 first, -1 last).','=XLOOKUP("P2",{"P1","P2"},{400,450},"Missing")',450,'Retrieve a specification or allowance.','Exact is the default. A first match does not aggregate duplicates. Binary search requires correctly sorted keys.'],
